{
    "version": "7.1.1",
    "description": "Inno Setup - 开源的 Windows 安装程序制作工具（静默安装模式：官方 7.x 安装器暂不支持 innounp/innoextract 解包）",
    "homepage": "https://www.jrsoftware.org/isinfo.php",
    "license": {
        "identifier": "Freeware",
        "url": "https://www.jrsoftware.org/files/is/license.txt"
    },
    "architecture": {
        "64bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/jrsoftware/issrc/releases/download/is-7_1_1/innosetup-7.1.1-x64.exe",
            "hash": "sha256:8a5a6711c3766a6e5fb74f280ba0e3551e719ce94538d901fdbd1f8f9920b3f0"
        },
        "32bit": {
            "url": "https://github.com/jrsoftware/issrc/releases/download/is-7_1_1/innosetup-7.1.1-x86.exe",
            "hash": "sha256:03446e46f5da932e408881168c01afc59cc667cb5bc927d839c5526ace5cc0d3"
        }
    },
    "installer": {
        "args": [
            "/VERYSILENT",
            "/SUPPRESSMSGBOXES",
            "/NORESTART",
            "/SP-",
            "/NOICONS",
            "/DIR=$dir"
        ]
    },
    "post_uninstall": [
        "if (Test-Path \"$dir\\unins000.exe\") { Start-Process -FilePath \"$dir\\unins000.exe\" -ArgumentList '/VERYSILENT','/SUPPRESSMSGBOXES','/NORESTART' -Wait }"
    ],
    "bin": [
        "ISCC.exe",
        "ISSigTool.exe"
    ],
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "ISIDE.exe",
            "Inno Setup Compiler"
        ]
    ],
    "checkver": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/jrsoftware/issrc/releases/latest",
        "regex": "innosetup-([\\d.]+)-x64\\.exe"
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "architecture": {
            "64bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/jrsoftware/issrc/releases/download/is-$underscoreVersion/innosetup-$version-x64.exe"
            },
            "32bit": {
                "url": "https://github.com/jrsoftware/issrc/releases/download/is-$underscoreVersion/innosetup-$version-x86.exe"
            }
        },
        "hash": {
            "url": "$url.issig",
            "find": "file-hash\\s+$sha256"
        }
    },
    "notes": [
        "官方 7.x 安装器暂不被 innounp 2.71.2 / innoextract 1.9 支持（解包报 setup files corrupted），故改用 Inno 静默安装到 Scoop 版本目录。",
        "卸载时 post_uninstall 会先运行官方 unins000.exe 清理注册表/关联，再由 Scoop 删除文件。"
    ]
}